### Functional Requirements : 
- Get top k most viewed videos of all time
- Get top k most viewed videos of last year/month/week/day/hour

For simplicity we will assume tumbling time windows i.e [1st Jan - 31st Jan], [1st Feb - 28th Feb].... We wont support sliding time window.

#### Out of scope
- Absolute time windows

### Non functional req :
- 1 minute of time between the event happens and it gets accounted in the top k
- ~10 ms of latency for GET
- 1 Billion videos
- 100k views per second
- Precise results (No approximation)

### Core Entities
- Video
- View
- TimeWindow

### APIs
- GET /views/top-k?window={}&k={}   -> [{videoId, views}]

